1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Video ya leo ni nini? Ni mazungumzo katika izakaya.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
Sehemu ya 1: Kuhifadhi na Kuongoza Kwenye Izakaya / Utangulizi wa Kuhifadhi na Kukaa Izakaya

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:13,341
Karibu sana.

4
00:00:13,364 --> 00:00:15,938
Karibu kwenye izakaya yetu.

5
00:00:15,961 --> 00:00:18,860
Hujambo, tuko wawili.

6
00:00:18,884 --> 00:00:20,650
Vema, nimekuelewa.

7
00:00:20,673 --> 00:00:23,676
Je, umefanya hifadhi kwa leo?

8
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:27,033
Hapana, sijahifadhi.

9
00:00:27,056 --> 00:00:29,023
Vema, nimekuelewa.

10
00:00:29,046 --> 00:00:31,479
Hakuna tatizo.

11
00:00:31,502 --> 00:00:33,311
Sawa, asante.

12
00:00:33,334 --> 00:00:35,868
Je, unavuta sigara?

13
00:00:35,891 --> 00:00:38,741
Hapana, sipavuti.

14
00:00:38,764 --> 00:00:41,702
Tafadhali, nape sehemu isiyoruhusu uvutaji wa sigara.

15
00:00:41,725 --> 00:00:43,892
Vema, nimekuelewa.

16
00:00:43,915 --> 00:00:47,048
Nitakuelekeza kwenye sehemu isiyokuwa na uvutaji wa sigara.

17
00:00:47,071 --> 00:00:48,688
Asante sana.

18
00:00:48,712 --> 00:00:50,802
Je, ni sehemu ya ndani?

19
00:00:50,825 --> 00:00:54,825
Ndiyo, ni meza ya ndani.

20
00:00:54,848 --> 00:00:56,692
Tafadhali njoo hapa.

21
00:00:56,716 --> 00:00:59,516
Sehemu hii ni safi na yenye mwanga mzuri.

22
00:00:59,539 --> 00:01:01,436
Asante sana.

23
00:01:01,460 --> 00:01:04,193
Je, sehemu hii inakufaa?

24
00:01:04,216 --> 00:01:07,508
Ndiyo, ni sehemu nzuri sana.

25
00:01:07,532 --> 00:01:10,932
Tafadhali weka mizigo yako kwenye boksi hii.

26
00:01:10,955 --> 00:01:12,955
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

27
00:01:12,978 --> 00:01:15,911
Asante kwa kunieleza.

28
00:01:15,934 --> 00:01:18,272
Leo kuna watu wengi, eh?

29
00:01:18,296 --> 00:01:22,232
Kwa sababu ni Ijumaa, kuna wateja wengi.

30
00:01:22,256 --> 00:01:24,589
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

31
00:01:24,612 --> 00:01:27,022
Nafurahi tulifika.

32
00:01:27,046 --> 00:01:29,779
Je, mtu ambaye umekuja naye atakuja hivi punde?

33
00:01:29,802 --> 00:01:33,235
Ndiyo, atakuja baada ya dakika tano.

34
00:01:33,258 --> 00:01:35,025
Vema, nimekuelewa.

35
00:01:35,048 --> 00:01:37,697
Nitakuletea menyu.

36
00:01:37,721 --> 00:01:39,411
Tafadhali.

37
00:01:39,434 --> 00:01:41,968
Naomba maji pia.

38
00:01:41,991 --> 00:01:45,268
Ndiyo, nitakuletea mara moja.

39
00:01:45,291 --> 00:01:49,098
Kodi ya QR juu ya meza ni nini?

40
00:01:49,122 --> 00:01:53,255
Ni kodi ya QR ambayo unaweza kufanya oda kwa simu yako.

41
00:01:53,278 --> 00:01:55,122
Ni rahisi sana!

42
00:01:55,145 --> 00:01:58,029
Nitapiga oda kwa simu yangu.

43
00:01:58,053 --> 00:02:02,086
Kuna menyu ya karatasi pia, unaweza kutumia.

44
00:02:02,109 --> 00:02:04,242
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

45
00:02:04,265 --> 00:02:06,032
Asante sana.

46
00:02:06,055 --> 00:02:09,633
Basi, chukua muda wako kuchagua.

47
00:02:09,656 --> 00:02:13,223
Asante sana.

48
00:02:13,246 --> 00:02:22,255
Skripu ya video ya leo inaweza kupakuliwa kutoka maelezo na maoni ya juu. Tafadhali achia maoni kabla ya kupakua.

49
00:02:22,255 --> 00:02:23,755
Sehemu ya 2: Misingi ya Maadili ya Huduma kwa Wateja / Misingi ya Maadili ya Huduma kwa Wateja

50
00:02:23,755 --> 00:02:26,633
Umechoka sana leo pia.

51
00:02:26,656 --> 00:02:29,195
Twendeni kazi.

52
00:02:29,219 --> 00:02:31,752
Tafadhali nisaidie.

53
00:02:31,775 --> 00:02:34,433
Nifanye nini?

54
00:02:34,457 --> 00:02:39,754
Kwanza, kazi baada ya kuwafuata wateja.

55
00:02:39,778 --> 00:02:43,258
Nitakumbuka vizuri.

56
00:02:43,281 --> 00:02:48,155
Baada ya wateja kukaa, mpe karatasi ya kunawia mara moja.

57
00:02:48,179 --> 00:02:50,589
Hii ni kitambaa kitakacho dondosha, ndiyo?

58
00:02:50,612 --> 00:02:53,020
Kitakacho dondosha au kimewashwa?

59
00:02:53,043 --> 00:02:57,843
Ndiyo, tafadhali nipatie kitambaa kitakacho dondosha.

60
00:02:57,866 --> 00:02:59,833
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

61
00:02:59,856 --> 00:03:02,500
Je, nitakupa kwa mikono yote miwili?

62
00:03:02,523 --> 00:03:08,123
Ndiyo, nitakuelekeza kwa adabu na kusema 'Karibu sana' wakati nikikupatia.

63
00:03:08,146 --> 00:03:09,780
Sawa.

64
00:03:09,803 --> 00:03:12,940
Nitamkuta kwa sauti kubwa.

65
00:03:12,964 --> 00:03:17,497
Kisha, nitawaweka menyu mezani.

66
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:21,120
Je, kila mtu atapata menyu yake?

67
00:03:21,144 --> 00:03:26,024
Hapana, kwa kundi moja, vitabu viwili vya menyu viko sawa.

68
00:03:26,048 --> 00:03:28,514
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

69
00:03:28,537 --> 00:03:31,504
Je, nitatoa maji pia?

70
00:03:31,528 --> 00:03:36,534
Tunahudumu kwenye izakaya, kwa hiyo kwanza nitatoa maji baridi au chai.

71
00:03:36,557 --> 00:03:40,757
Je, nitawauliza wateja ni nini wanachopendelea?

72
00:03:40,780 --> 00:03:42,747
Ndiyo.

73
00:03:42,770 --> 00:03:47,451
Uliza kama wanataka chai moto au maji baridi.

74
00:03:47,474 --> 00:03:49,927
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

75
00:03:49,950 --> 00:03:53,364
Je, ni vyema nikachukue maelezo?

76
00:03:53,388 --> 00:03:57,121
Mwanzoni, tafadhali chukua maelezo. Sawa.

77
00:03:57,144 --> 00:04:00,477
Nitakagua daftari na kalamu.

78
00:04:00,500 --> 00:04:04,734
Kisha, nionyeshe ubao wa mapendeleo ya leo.

79
00:04:04,757 --> 00:04:08,643
Ubao wa mapendeleo uko wapi?

80
00:04:08,666 --> 00:04:12,120
Uko juu ya kabati karibu na jikoni.

81
00:04:12,143 --> 00:04:14,156
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

82
00:04:14,179 --> 00:04:16,413
Nitakagua.

83
00:04:16,436 --> 00:04:20,678
Wakiamua oda, waweza kubonyeza kitufe.

84
00:04:20,701 --> 00:04:24,874
Ikiwa buzzer italia sauti, nitakwenda mara moja, ndiyo?

85
00:04:24,897 --> 00:04:27,830
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

86
00:04:27,853 --> 00:04:30,387
Tumikie kwa tabasamu.

87
00:04:30,410 --> 00:04:32,043
Sawa.

88
00:04:32,066 --> 00:04:33,999
Nitapiga kwa nguvu.

89
00:04:34,022 --> 00:04:38,075
Kama kuna chochote usichokielewa, wasihesabu kuuliza.

90
00:04:38,099 --> 00:04:39,766
Sawa.

91
00:04:39,790 --> 00:04:42,556
Tafadhali nisaidie.

92
00:04:42,579 --> 00:04:49,684
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua video ya leo kipo kwenye sehemu ya maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kufutwa bila tahadhari.

93
00:04:49,684 --> 00:04:51,184
Sehemu ya 3: Mazoezi ya Kupokea Maagizo / Mazoezi ya Kupokea Maagizo

94
00:04:51,184 --> 00:04:53,584
Karibu sana.

95
00:04:53,607 --> 00:04:57,293
Je, mmeamua oda yenu?

96
00:04:57,317 --> 00:05:02,590
Ndiyo, kwanza ningependa kuagiza vinywaji.

97
00:05:02,614 --> 00:05:04,890
Vema, nimekuelewa.

98
00:05:04,913 --> 00:05:07,713
Unataka nini?

99
00:05:07,736 --> 00:05:12,936
Kwa sasa, nitapenda bia mbili za kawaida.

100
00:05:12,959 --> 00:05:16,233
Bia mbili za kawaida, ndiyo.

101
00:05:16,256 --> 00:05:18,428
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

102
00:05:18,451 --> 00:05:23,418
Aa, rafiki yangu anasema anataka haibōru.

103
00:05:23,441 --> 00:05:30,316
Kwa hiyo, bia moja ya kawaida na haibōru moja?

104
00:05:30,339 --> 00:05:33,754
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

105
00:05:33,778 --> 00:05:39,044
Haibōru inaweza kuwa nzito au nyepesi, unataka ipi?

106
00:05:39,067 --> 00:05:42,304
Kawaida ya kutosha.

107
00:05:42,328 --> 00:05:44,409
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

108
00:05:44,433 --> 00:05:48,166
Je, unataka barafu?

109
00:05:48,189 --> 00:05:52,085
Ndiyo, tafadhali weka barafu.

110
00:05:52,109 --> 00:05:58,509
Bia ya kawaida ina ukubwa mkubwa na mdogo.

111
00:05:58,532 --> 00:06:01,340
Nitapenda ukubwa wa kati.

112
00:06:01,364 --> 00:06:04,097
Bia ya kawaida ya ukubwa wa kati, ndiyo.

113
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:06,411
Vema, nimekuelewa.

114
00:06:06,434 --> 00:06:09,434
Vinywaji vitakuja mara moja?

115
00:06:09,457 --> 00:06:14,024
Ndiyo, tutakutengenezea na kukuletea mara moja.

116
00:06:14,047 --> 00:06:15,742
Asante sana.

117
00:06:15,765 --> 00:06:18,165
Ninangojea kwa hamu.

118
00:06:18,188 --> 00:06:21,261
Kuna chakula cha leo cha kuwashia njaa?

119
00:06:21,284 --> 00:06:25,217
Leo tuna njegere na sahani ndogo.

120
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:27,207
Nzuri sana.

121
00:06:27,230 --> 00:06:29,724
Tafadhali, naomba kile kinachotangulia.

122
00:06:29,748 --> 00:06:32,003
Vema, nimekuelewa.

123
00:06:32,026 --> 00:06:35,026
Kile kinachotangulia, mara mbili, ndiyo.

124
00:06:35,049 --> 00:06:38,882
Je, naweza kuagiza chakula baadaye?

125
00:06:38,905 --> 00:06:43,156
Ndiyo, mtatufahamisha mara tu mtaamua.

126
00:06:43,180 --> 00:06:45,187
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

127
00:06:45,211 --> 00:06:48,277
Nitatazama menyu polepole.

128
00:06:48,300 --> 00:06:53,034
Basi, nitawaletea bia ya kawaida na haiboru.

129
00:06:53,057 --> 00:06:56,195
Sawa, naomba.

130
00:06:56,218 --> 00:06:58,854
Subiri kidogo tafadhali.

131
00:06:58,878 --> 00:07:01,912
Sawa, tunangojea.

132
00:07:01,936 --> 00:07:03,436
Sehemu ya 4: Kuburudika Baada ya Kazi / Cheers After Work

133
00:07:03,436 --> 00:07:06,120
Mmeshughulika sana leo.

134
00:07:06,143 --> 00:07:08,745
Vinywaji vimefika.

135
00:07:08,768 --> 00:07:11,228
Mmeshughulika sana leo.

136
00:07:11,251 --> 00:07:14,136
Kinywa changu kimekauka.

137
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:19,693
Basi, wiki hii pia mmeshughulika sana kazini.

138
00:07:19,716 --> 00:07:22,450
Asante kwa bidii yenu.

139
00:07:22,473 --> 00:07:24,839
Hebu tukanumbuke.

140
00:07:24,862 --> 00:07:26,829
Heko!

141
00:07:26,852 --> 00:07:29,019
Heko!

142
00:07:29,042 --> 00:07:34,775
Gok, gok... ah! Tamu sana!

143
00:07:34,798 --> 00:07:40,246
Ni kweli, bia ni baridi sana na nzuri kabisa!

144
00:07:40,269 --> 00:07:45,157
Bia baada ya kazi ni tamu mno.

145
00:07:45,181 --> 00:07:50,548
Bia ya hapa ina povu nzuri sana.

146
00:07:50,571 --> 00:07:52,706
Ni kweli.

147
00:07:52,729 --> 00:07:56,104
Iko baridi na nywelezi.

148
00:07:56,127 --> 00:07:59,706
Kinywaji kimoja nimeshapunguza nusu.

149
00:07:59,729 --> 00:08:03,496
Ehe, una kinywa cha haraka.

150
00:08:03,519 --> 00:08:07,418
Leo tulikuwa na shughuli nyingi sana.

151
00:08:07,441 --> 00:08:11,516
Tulifanya kazi za ziada pia.

152
00:08:11,539 --> 00:08:15,792
Kwa hiyo, kinywaji hiki ni tamu mno.

153
00:08:15,815 --> 00:08:19,382
Hebu tukale edamame.

154
00:08:19,405 --> 00:08:23,249
Aa, yenye chumvi, tamu sana!

155
00:08:23,272 --> 00:08:26,072
Inalingana na bia kabisa.

156
00:08:26,095 --> 00:08:28,982
Ni kiburudisho cha hali ya juu.

157
00:08:29,005 --> 00:08:32,239
Usinywe mno.

158
00:08:32,263 --> 00:08:34,339
Hakuna matata.

159
00:08:34,363 --> 00:08:36,899
Leo tutaonja na kunywa kwa furaha.

160
00:08:36,922 --> 00:08:41,701
Ndiyo, na tutaagiza chakula kitamu pia.

161
00:08:41,724 --> 00:08:44,005
Nzuri sana.

162
00:08:44,029 --> 00:08:47,243
Hebu tutazame menyu.

163
00:08:47,267 --> 00:08:50,915
Lakini kwanza nitaonywa tena kidogo.

164
00:08:50,938 --> 00:08:53,305
Mimi pia nitaonywa.

165
00:08:53,328 --> 00:08:56,102
Hmm, tamu.

166
00:08:56,126 --> 00:08:59,261
Hii ni dakika ya furaha.

167
00:08:59,284 --> 00:09:03,096
Nimefurahi sana kuja izakaya.

168
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:06,920
Leo tutazungumza kwa furaha.

169
00:09:06,943 --> 00:09:11,283
Ndiyo, tutaendelea kunywa pamoja hadi mwisho.

170
00:09:11,306 --> 00:09:12,806
Sehemu ya 5: Jinsi ya Kuamua Chakula cha Kuagiza / How to Decide What to Order

171
00:09:12,806 --> 00:09:17,073
Sasa, hebu tuagize chakula.

172
00:09:17,096 --> 00:09:19,029
Nzuri sana.

173
00:09:19,052 --> 00:09:21,670
Unataka kula nini?

174
00:09:21,694 --> 00:09:24,927
Ninapenda chakula cha nyama.

175
00:09:24,950 --> 00:09:29,117
Kuna kuku wa kung'u na yakitori.

176
00:09:29,140 --> 00:09:31,774
Ina mashaka, kweli.

177
00:09:31,797 --> 00:09:34,332
Unapendelea ipi?

178
00:09:34,356 --> 00:09:38,289
Mimi napenda kuku wa kung'u.

179
00:09:38,312 --> 00:09:43,845
Kuku wa kung'u ni nzuri, lakini pia siwezi kuacha yakitori.

180
00:09:43,868 --> 00:09:49,302
Yakitori unapenda yenye chumvi au yenye mchuzi?

181
00:09:49,325 --> 00:09:53,858
Mimi napenda mchuzi tamu.

182
00:09:53,881 --> 00:09:57,814
Mimi napenda yenye chumvi, inayofanya niwe fresh.

183
00:09:57,837 --> 00:10:02,304
Basi, tuagize seti ya pamoja?

184
00:10:02,327 --> 00:10:06,694
Seti ya pamoja ina zote mbili.

185
00:10:06,717 --> 00:10:11,328
Unaweza kuagiza zote mbili, yenye chumvi na yenye mchuzi.

186
00:10:11,352 --> 00:10:14,231
Hiyo ni wazo zuri sana.

187
00:10:14,255 --> 00:10:18,388
Je, tuagize sahani ya kuku wa kung'u pia?

188
00:10:18,411 --> 00:10:20,445
Nzuri sana.

189
00:10:20,468 --> 00:10:23,305
Tukale zote mbili.

190
00:10:23,328 --> 00:10:25,895
Unaweza kula zote?

191
00:10:25,918 --> 00:10:29,851
Labda kiasi kinaweza kuwa kingi.

192
00:10:29,874 --> 00:10:33,508
Nina njaa sana, nitaweza.

193
00:10:33,531 --> 00:10:36,864
Twaagize saladi pia.

194
00:10:36,887 --> 00:10:39,720
Saladi ya Caesar je, inafaa?

195
00:10:39,743 --> 00:10:42,230
Napenda sana.

196
00:10:42,254 --> 00:10:44,550
Basi, tutaamua hivyo.

197
00:10:44,573 --> 00:10:47,858
Saladi ya tofu pia inaonekana nzuri.

198
00:10:47,881 --> 00:10:51,948
Leo, je, tuamue saladi ya Caesar?

199
00:10:51,971 --> 00:10:54,145
Nimeelewa.

200
00:10:54,169 --> 00:10:56,602
Tufanye hivyo.

201
00:10:56,625 --> 00:10:59,958
Seti ya sashimi pia ni nzuri.

202
00:10:59,981 --> 00:11:04,434
Leo kuna samaki anayependekezwa.

203
00:11:04,457 --> 00:11:08,824
Je, tuagize samaki na nyama zote?

204
00:11:08,847 --> 00:11:13,023
Ni afadhali kuagiza kidogo kidogo ili kuwa salama.

205
00:11:13,047 --> 00:11:14,680
Ndiyo.

206
00:11:14,703 --> 00:11:17,757
Kwanza nyama na saladi.

207
00:11:17,781 --> 00:11:19,347
Sawa.

208
00:11:19,370 --> 00:11:22,137
Twite mhudumu.

209
00:11:22,160 --> 00:11:23,660
Sehemu ya 6: Kuagiza na Kupendekeza Sahani

210
00:11:23,660 --> 00:11:26,111
Mliitwa?

211
00:11:26,135 --> 00:11:29,404
Tunapokea maagizo yenu.

212
00:11:29,427 --> 00:11:33,630
Samahani, leo mnapendekeza nini?

213
00:11:33,654 --> 00:11:38,987
Pendekezo la leo ni seti ya sashimi ya samaki safi.

214
00:11:39,010 --> 00:11:42,143
Samaki gani wamo ndani?

215
00:11:42,166 --> 00:11:46,439
Kuna tuna, samoni na kanpachi.

216
00:11:46,463 --> 00:11:48,732
Inaonekana nzuri.

217
00:11:48,755 --> 00:11:52,355
Hii ndiyo samaki tamu zaidi siku hii?

218
00:11:52,378 --> 00:11:56,845
Samaki hizi zilifika kutoka bandarini asubuhi hii.

219
00:11:56,868 --> 00:11:59,901
Hiyo ni nzuri sana.

220
00:11:59,924 --> 00:12:02,157
Tunapenda moja.

221
00:12:02,180 --> 00:12:03,780
Asante sana.

222
00:12:03,803 --> 00:12:06,437
Seti ya sashimi, basi.

223
00:12:06,460 --> 00:12:10,026
Kuna vyakula vingine vya kula pamoja vinavyopendwa?

224
00:12:10,049 --> 00:12:14,666
Mayai ya kuchemsha yenye dashi ambayo tunayoyatayarisha hapa ni maarufu sana.

225
00:12:14,690 --> 00:12:17,166
Mayai ya kuchemsha yenye dashi?

226
00:12:17,190 --> 00:12:19,190
Yako moto?

227
00:12:19,213 --> 00:12:23,261
Ndiyo, tunayachoma baada ya kupokea agizo.

228
00:12:23,284 --> 00:12:26,485
Inaonekana laini na nzuri.

229
00:12:26,509 --> 00:12:31,349
Dashi inayofanya iwe ladha nzuri sana.

230
00:12:31,372 --> 00:12:35,612
Basi, naomba tamago ya dashimaki moja tafadhali.

231
00:12:35,636 --> 00:12:40,636
Tunao pia tamago ya dashimaki yenye mentaiko na jibini.

232
00:12:40,659 --> 00:12:44,037
Eeh, mentaiko na jibini?

233
00:12:44,060 --> 00:12:48,542
Ni maarufu sana kwa mama zetu wateja.

234
00:12:48,566 --> 00:12:51,766
Ni ipi unapendekeza, ya kawaida au hii?

235
00:12:51,789 --> 00:12:55,875
Mentaiko inalingana sana na pombe.

236
00:12:55,898 --> 00:12:59,501
Basi, nitachukua ile yenye mentaiko.

237
00:12:59,525 --> 00:13:01,558
Vema, nimekuelewa.

238
00:13:01,581 --> 00:13:04,581
Hakika itakuwa tamu sana!

239
00:13:04,604 --> 00:13:06,891
Ninangojea kwa hamu.

240
00:13:06,915 --> 00:13:09,558
Je, unataka vyakula vilivyokaangwa?

241
00:13:09,581 --> 00:13:13,948
Ni chakula gani kilichokaangwa kinachopendekezwa zaidi?

242
00:13:13,971 --> 00:13:18,021
Tunapendekeza Toriten, chakula maarufu cha Oita.

243
00:13:18,044 --> 00:13:19,928
Toriten?

244
00:13:19,951 --> 00:13:22,728
Ni chakula kinacholetwa na sosini ya ponzu.

245
00:13:22,752 --> 00:13:27,118
Ni tamu na laini, unaweza kula vingi hata usikate tamaa.

246
00:13:27,141 --> 00:13:29,427
Nitakula hicho pia moja tafadhali.

247
00:13:29,451 --> 00:13:31,522
Vema, nimekuelewa.

248
00:13:31,546 --> 00:13:34,712
Umeagiza vizuri sana!

249
00:13:34,735 --> 00:13:36,235
Sehemu ya 7: Kuagiza na Kukabiliana na Maradhi ya Chakula / Agizo na Kukabiliana na Allerjia

250
00:13:36,235 --> 00:13:39,505
Tunapokea maagizo yako.

251
00:13:39,529 --> 00:13:42,746
Ningependa kuagiza chaofa hii.

252
00:13:42,769 --> 00:13:45,036
Chaofa ya aina tano, ndiyo.

253
00:13:45,059 --> 00:13:46,659
Asante sana.

254
00:13:46,682 --> 00:13:52,515
Samahani, naomba kuuliza, je kuna uduvi ndani?

255
00:13:52,538 --> 00:13:54,016
Sawa.

256
00:13:54,039 --> 00:13:57,016
Ndani kuna uduvi.

257
00:13:57,040 --> 00:14:01,573
Nina maradhi ya chakula, na siwezi kula uduvi.

258
00:14:01,596 --> 00:14:04,074
Aa, ndivyo.

259
00:14:04,098 --> 00:14:06,667
Una maradhi ya chakula basi.

260
00:14:06,690 --> 00:14:11,023
Je, unaweza kuifanya bila uduvi?

261
00:14:11,046 --> 00:14:13,713
Subiri kidogo tafadhali.

262
00:14:13,736 --> 00:14:16,584
Nitakwenda kuuliza jikoni.

263
00:14:16,608 --> 00:14:19,008
Samahani kwa taabu.

264
00:14:19,031 --> 00:14:21,206
Tafadhali nisaidie.

265
00:14:21,230 --> 00:14:23,523
Umechelewa kidogo.

266
00:14:23,546 --> 00:14:27,152
Tunaweza kuifanya bila uduvi.

267
00:14:27,176 --> 00:14:29,109
Kweli?

268
00:14:29,132 --> 00:14:31,099
Asante sana.

269
00:14:31,121 --> 00:14:34,855
Je, kuna vyakula vingine unavyokuwa na maradhi?

270
00:14:34,878 --> 00:14:38,319
Mayai na nyama ya nguruwe sina shida.

271
00:14:38,342 --> 00:14:40,709
Ni uduvi na kaa tu.

272
00:14:40,732 --> 00:14:42,776
Vema, nimekuelewa.

273
00:14:42,799 --> 00:14:45,766
Tutaiandaa bila uduvi.

274
00:14:45,789 --> 00:14:51,189
Kitunguu pia sipendi sana, je unaweza kupunguza kidogo?

275
00:14:51,212 --> 00:14:55,412
Tunaweza kuifanya hata bila kitunguu, je unaweza?

276
00:14:55,435 --> 00:14:59,132
Basi, nitafanya bila kitunguu pia.

277
00:14:59,155 --> 00:15:01,355
Nimekuelewa.

278
00:15:01,378 --> 00:15:04,580
Bila uduvi, bila kitunguu, ndiyo.

279
00:15:04,604 --> 00:15:07,470
Samahani kwa kuwa na maombi mengi.

280
00:15:07,493 --> 00:15:10,460
Hapana, usijali.

281
00:15:10,483 --> 00:15:14,449
Nimefurahi sana na ukaribu wako.

282
00:15:14,472 --> 00:15:18,639
Saladi yetu haina uduvi katika dressing yake.

283
00:15:18,662 --> 00:15:22,999
Aa, nilikuwa na nia ya kuagiza saladi pia.

284
00:15:23,023 --> 00:15:27,037
Dressing yetu ni ya Kijapani, unaweza kula bila wasiwasi.

285
00:15:27,061 --> 00:15:31,102
Basi, nitachukua saladi ya Kijapani moja tafadhali.

286
00:15:31,126 --> 00:15:33,292
Vema, nimekuelewa.

287
00:15:33,315 --> 00:15:35,882
Saladi na chaofa, ndiyo.

288
00:15:35,905 --> 00:15:37,838
Tafadhali nisaidie.

289
00:15:37,861 --> 00:15:41,636
Nitakupikia chakula kitamu, tafadhali subiri kidogo.

290
00:15:41,660 --> 00:15:44,936
Sawa, ninafurahi kusubiri.

291
00:15:44,959 --> 00:15:46,459
Mstari 8: Tofauti za Mapendeleo ya Ladha / Differences in Taste Preferences

292
00:15:46,459 --> 00:15:51,426
Ladha za chakula zinatofautiana kwa kila mtu, sivyo?

293
00:15:51,449 --> 00:15:53,715
Ndiyo.

294
00:15:53,738 --> 00:15:57,154
Unapenda chakula cha pilipili?

295
00:15:57,178 --> 00:15:59,850
Napenda sana.

296
00:15:59,873 --> 00:16:04,806
Napenda mapofu ya maharage na vyakula vya Kikorea.

297
00:16:04,829 --> 00:16:06,966
Kweli?

298
00:16:06,990 --> 00:16:11,556
Mimi sipendi pilipili kabisa.

299
00:16:11,579 --> 00:16:16,398
Eeh! Hata kimchi huwezi kula?

300
00:16:16,422 --> 00:16:21,467
Kimchi pia ni kali kidogo kwa ajili yangu.

301
00:16:21,491 --> 00:16:23,749
Ndiyo hivyo.

302
00:16:23,772 --> 00:16:28,439
Unapenda vyakula vyenye tamu au ladha nyepesi?

303
00:16:28,462 --> 00:16:34,862
Ndiyo, napenda vyakula vya Kijapani vyenye dashi na mchuzi tamu.

304
00:16:34,885 --> 00:16:36,697
Nimeelewa.

305
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:41,287
Basi leo nitahitaji kuwa makini na oda yangu.

306
00:16:41,310 --> 00:16:45,743
Unaweza kula chakula cha pilipili peke yako?

307
00:16:45,766 --> 00:16:50,343
Leo tutakula chakula kisicho na pilipili pamoja.

308
00:16:50,367 --> 00:16:52,537
Umekuwa mpole sana.

309
00:16:52,561 --> 00:16:54,327
Asante sana.

310
00:16:54,350 --> 00:16:57,950
Unapenda tamagoyaki tamu?

311
00:16:57,974 --> 00:17:00,374
Napenda sana.

312
00:17:00,397 --> 00:17:03,167
Hiyo ni ladha ya mama.

313
00:17:03,191 --> 00:17:05,357
Nzuri sana.

314
00:17:05,380 --> 00:17:09,047
Basi tutaagiza tamagoyaki.

315
00:17:09,070 --> 00:17:13,758
Unapenda samaki wa nyama nyeupe kama sushi au sashimi?

316
00:17:13,782 --> 00:17:16,348
Napenda sana.

317
00:17:16,371 --> 00:17:18,938
Ningependa kula kila siku.

318
00:17:18,961 --> 00:17:23,928
Mimi pia napenda sashimi sana.

319
00:17:23,951 --> 00:17:26,448
Tunapendana kwa ladha.

320
00:17:26,471 --> 00:17:29,037
Nzuri sana!

321
00:17:29,060 --> 00:17:32,394
Napenda maguro na samoni.

322
00:17:32,417 --> 00:17:36,428
Mimi napenda samaki wa nyama nyeupe.

323
00:17:36,452 --> 00:17:38,625
Kama hirame.

324
00:17:38,648 --> 00:17:41,541
Ladha ya watu wazima.

325
00:17:41,564 --> 00:17:45,043
Inaonekana nitakunywa pombe zaidi.

326
00:17:45,067 --> 00:17:50,123
Kuhusu pombe, unakunywa cocktail tamu?

327
00:17:50,147 --> 00:17:53,580
Sipendi sana.

328
00:17:53,603 --> 00:17:57,770
Napenda ulong highi wenye ladha safi.

329
00:17:57,793 --> 00:18:03,726
Mimi napenda umeeshu tamu na cassis orange.

330
00:18:03,749 --> 00:18:08,116
Ladha zako ni tofauti na zangu, ni ya kuvutia.

331
00:18:08,139 --> 00:18:13,141
Tofauti zinazifanya tuongee zaidi ni nzuri.

332
00:18:13,165 --> 00:18:15,131
Ni kweli.

333
00:18:15,154 --> 00:18:19,221
Tuambiane maduka yetu ya kupendelea.

334
00:18:19,244 --> 00:18:21,653
Nzuri sana.

335
00:18:21,676 --> 00:18:26,692
Mara ijayo nitakupa anwani ya mgahawa wa Kijapani unaopendelea.

336
00:18:26,716 --> 00:18:32,370
Nitakupa anwani ya mgahawa wa chakula cha pilipili sana.

337
00:18:32,393 --> 00:18:36,843
Tafadhali epuka kuwa kali mno.

338
00:18:36,867 --> 00:18:38,367
Mstari 9: Kutolea Chakula na Kukabiliana na Maombi / Serving Food and Handling Requests

339
00:18:38,367 --> 00:18:41,700
Tumekuletea chakula chako.

340
00:18:41,723 --> 00:18:44,456
Hii ni karaage.

341
00:18:44,479 --> 00:18:48,213
Waa, inaonekana tamu sana!

342
00:18:48,236 --> 00:18:51,089
Asante sana.

343
00:18:51,112 --> 00:18:54,645
Tafadhali chukua muda wako na kufurahia chakula.

344
00:18:54,668 --> 00:18:57,635
Aa, samahani.

345
00:18:57,658 --> 00:19:00,729
Naomba kidogo?

346
00:19:00,752 --> 00:19:03,971
Ndiyo, naomba nini?

347
00:19:03,995 --> 00:19:08,034
Tafadhali niletee sahani tatu.

348
00:19:08,058 --> 00:19:10,465
Vema, nimekuelewa.

349
00:19:10,488 --> 00:19:13,505
Sahani ndogo tatu, tafadhali.

350
00:19:13,528 --> 00:19:20,128
Kisha, nimeangusha vijiti vya chakula chini, naomba vipya tafadhali.

351
00:19:20,151 --> 00:19:22,793
Samahani sana.

352
00:19:22,817 --> 00:19:26,502
Nitakuletea vijiti vipya mara moja.

353
00:19:26,526 --> 00:19:28,159
Asante sana.

354
00:19:28,182 --> 00:19:30,061
Asante sana.

355
00:19:30,084 --> 00:19:33,781
Je, ungependa nikuongezee glasi ya maji?

356
00:19:33,805 --> 00:19:38,405
Aa, naomba glasi mbili tupu, tafadhali.

357
00:19:38,428 --> 00:19:42,299
Glasizi kwa kugawanya bia ya chupa, ndiyo?

358
00:19:42,323 --> 00:19:45,256
Ndiyo, sahihi.

359
00:19:45,279 --> 00:19:47,967
Nipatie glasizi ndogo kidogo.

360
00:19:47,990 --> 00:19:50,364
Vema, nimekuelewa.

361
00:19:50,388 --> 00:19:53,668
Nitakutayarishia mara moja.

362
00:19:53,691 --> 00:19:57,191
Je, naweza kuongeza taulo au kitambaa cha kunywa mikono?

363
00:19:57,214 --> 00:20:03,393
Ndiyo, nitakuletea kitambaa cha kunywa mikono kipya na moto.

364
00:20:03,417 --> 00:20:05,670
Asante kwa kusaidia kwa kila kitu.

365
00:20:05,693 --> 00:20:09,761
La hasha, usijali.

366
00:20:09,784 --> 00:20:15,879
Wafanyakazi wa mgahawa huu wote ni wakaribu na wa haraka sana!

367
00:20:15,903 --> 00:20:17,480
Asante sana.

368
00:20:17,504 --> 00:20:21,937
Tunataka kugawanya chakula kabla ya kupoa.

369
00:20:21,960 --> 00:20:25,794
Nitakuletea haraka.

370
00:20:25,817 --> 00:20:27,217
Tafadhali.

371
00:20:27,240 --> 00:20:29,406
Umechelewa.

372
00:20:29,429 --> 00:20:33,232
Haya sahani ndogo na vijiti vya chakula.

373
00:20:33,255 --> 00:20:35,455
Umefika haraka sana!

374
00:20:35,478 --> 00:20:37,083
Asante sana.

375
00:20:37,107 --> 00:20:41,641
Nitakuweka hapa glasizi na kitambaa cha kunywa mikono pia.

376
00:20:41,664 --> 00:20:43,464
Kamili.

377
00:20:43,487 --> 00:20:46,053
Asante sana kweli.

378
00:20:46,076 --> 00:20:50,043
Je, kuna chochote kingine unachohitaji?

379
00:20:50,066 --> 00:20:53,320
Kwa sasa, hakuna.

380
00:20:53,344 --> 00:20:55,477
Nitakuita tena baadaye.

381
00:20:55,500 --> 00:20:57,000
Sehemu ya 10: Kushughulikia Maagizo Wakati wa Mchana Mzito / Kushughulikia Maagizo Wakati wa Mchana Mzito

382
00:20:57,000 --> 00:21:02,283
Saa mbili zimefika, mgahawa umejaa!

383
00:21:02,306 --> 00:21:06,139
Kengele za maagizo zinawika mara kwa mara!

384
00:21:06,162 --> 00:21:08,329
Tunapata shughuli nyingi.

385
00:21:08,352 --> 00:21:13,285
Tuliza na shughulikia maagizo moja kwa moja.

386
00:21:13,308 --> 00:21:14,978
Sawa.

387
00:21:15,002 --> 00:21:19,294
Kuna maagizo ya vinywaji kumi yanayotegemea.

388
00:21:19,317 --> 00:21:23,656
Mimi nitatayarisha bia na haibōru.

389
00:21:23,680 --> 00:21:29,113
Basi mimi nitashughulikia sāwa na vinywaji laini.

390
00:21:29,136 --> 00:21:31,108
Asante sana.

391
00:21:31,132 --> 00:21:34,066
Tugawane kazi ili tuwapatie haraka.

392
00:21:34,089 --> 00:21:39,691
Kuna meza ambazo huduma ya chakula imechukua muda mrefu kidogo.

393
00:21:39,714 --> 00:21:41,650
Meza ipi?

394
00:21:41,674 --> 00:21:43,956
Nitakagua.

395
00:21:43,979 --> 00:21:47,913
Meza ya tano na nane.

396
00:21:47,936 --> 00:21:52,829
Nitawasiliana na mpishi wa jikoni ili awashughulikie haraka.

397
00:21:52,852 --> 00:21:54,386
Tafadhali.

398
00:21:54,408 --> 00:21:58,105
Mimi nitakwenda kuomba msamaha kwa wateja.

399
00:21:58,128 --> 00:22:01,220
Uangalifu wako ni wa ajabu!

400
00:22:01,243 --> 00:22:03,721
Tafadhali nisaidie.

401
00:22:03,745 --> 00:22:07,155
Eeh, nimeanza kutokwa na jasho.

402
00:22:07,179 --> 00:22:09,857
Tunapata shughuli nyingi sana!

403
00:22:09,880 --> 00:22:14,214
Hiki ndicho kipindi kigumu zaidi.

404
00:22:14,237 --> 00:22:15,903
Tujitahidi.

405
00:22:15,927 --> 00:22:17,527
Sawa.

406
00:22:17,550 --> 00:22:21,583
Ninahisi salama kufanya kazi nawe, kiongozi.

407
00:22:21,606 --> 00:22:23,940
Mimi pia.

408
00:22:23,963 --> 00:22:26,849
Urembo wako wa tabasamu ni mzuri sana.

409
00:22:26,872 --> 00:22:31,141
Tutazidi kuwahudumia wateja kwa tabasamu.

410
00:22:31,165 --> 00:22:34,698
Tunabaki na saa moja tu kisha tutapumzika.

411
00:22:34,721 --> 00:22:38,755
Sasa, nitaweka nguvu na kujitahidi kwa bidii.

412
00:22:38,778 --> 00:22:42,978
Usisahau kuchukua vifurushi vya vinywaji tafadhali.

413
00:22:43,001 --> 00:22:45,968
Ni barafu na glasi zinazohitajika.

414
00:22:45,991 --> 00:22:47,991
Nimekuelewa.

415
00:22:48,014 --> 00:22:52,581
Tafadhali, jihadhari usije ukajiumiza.

416
00:22:52,604 --> 00:22:53,694
Sawa.

417
00:22:53,718 --> 00:22:56,596
Nitakimbia kwa tahadhari ili nisikwaze miguu.

418
00:22:56,619 --> 00:23:00,452
Usikimbie, twende kwa kasi tu.

419
00:23:00,475 --> 00:23:02,922
Aa, ndivyo ilivyo.

420
00:23:02,946 --> 00:23:05,749
Usalama ndio kipaumbele.

421
00:23:05,773 --> 00:23:10,573
Baada ya kilele, tutaonja chakula kitamu cha nyumbani.

422
00:23:10,596 --> 00:23:13,596
Nitakaza nguvu kwa matarajio ya hicho.

423
00:23:13,619 --> 00:23:17,352
Sasa, vinywaji vimeandaliwa tayari.

424
00:23:17,375 --> 00:23:19,215
Chukua na uende.

425
00:23:19,238 --> 00:23:20,972
Sawa.

426
00:23:20,995 --> 00:23:23,079
Nitakwenda sasa.

427
00:23:23,102 --> 00:23:24,602
Sehemu ya 11: Kukabiliana na Ucheleweshaji wa Maagizo

428
00:23:24,602 --> 00:23:27,136
Ulinipigia nini?

429
00:23:27,159 --> 00:23:29,042
Nakujulia.

430
00:23:29,065 --> 00:23:30,798
Samahani,

431
00:23:30,821 --> 00:23:35,291
Chakula nilichokiamuru miaka thelathini iliyopita bado hakijafika.

432
00:23:35,315 --> 00:23:38,205
Samahani sana.

433
00:23:38,229 --> 00:23:41,029
Ni chakula gani hasa?

434
00:23:41,052 --> 00:23:45,018
Ni yakitori ya mchanganyiko na yakisoba.

435
00:23:45,041 --> 00:23:49,061
Yakitori ya mchanganyiko na yakisoba, ndivyo?

436
00:23:49,085 --> 00:23:51,485
Nitathibitisha.

437
00:23:51,508 --> 00:23:56,593
Vinywaji vilifika upesi, lakini chakula kimechelewa.

438
00:23:56,616 --> 00:24:00,435
Samahani sana kwa usumbufu.

439
00:24:00,459 --> 00:24:06,026
Unaweza kuuliza jikoni kuna nini sasa?

440
00:24:06,049 --> 00:24:09,827
Ndiyo, nitakwenda jikoni mara moja kuangalia.

441
00:24:09,850 --> 00:24:12,417
Subiri kidogo tafadhali.

442
00:24:12,440 --> 00:24:15,046
Sawa, naomba.

443
00:24:15,070 --> 00:24:17,403
Umechelewa.

444
00:24:17,426 --> 00:24:20,517
Nimekwenda jikoni kuangalia.

445
00:24:20,540 --> 00:24:22,507
Ilikuwaje?

446
00:24:22,530 --> 00:24:25,497
Maagizo yamepokelewa?

447
00:24:25,520 --> 00:24:28,855
Ndiyo, maagizo yameingia.

448
00:24:28,878 --> 00:24:31,337
Haya, basi vizuri.

449
00:24:31,360 --> 00:24:34,493
Bado itachukua muda gani?

450
00:24:34,516 --> 00:24:39,250
Yakitori inakuwa tayari sasa hivi.

451
00:24:39,273 --> 00:24:42,406
Itafika baada ya dakika tano hivi?

452
00:24:42,429 --> 00:24:45,796
Ndiyo, nitakuletea ndani ya dakika tatu.

453
00:24:45,818 --> 00:24:48,652
Yakisoba inaendeleaje?

454
00:24:48,675 --> 00:24:52,716
Yakisoba bado tunaanza kuipika sasa.

455
00:24:52,740 --> 00:24:56,176
Eeh, sasa hivi?

456
00:24:56,199 --> 00:24:59,135
Inaonekana itachukua muda.

457
00:24:59,158 --> 00:25:04,246
Kuna msongamano, hivyo maagizo yamechelewa.

458
00:25:04,270 --> 00:25:09,470
Nina saa ya mwisho ya treni, naweza kufuta yakisoba?

459
00:25:09,493 --> 00:25:14,826
Ndiyo, bado hatujaanza kuipika, unaweza kufuta.

460
00:25:14,849 --> 00:25:18,538
Basi, nifute yakisoba tafadhali.

461
00:25:18,562 --> 00:25:20,728
Nimekuelewa.

462
00:25:20,751 --> 00:25:23,446
Samahani sana.

463
00:25:23,470 --> 00:25:27,637
Asante kwa kuangalia.

464
00:25:27,660 --> 00:25:32,326
Yakitori nitakuletea mara moja, subiri kidogo.

465
00:25:32,349 --> 00:25:35,202
Sawa, asante sana.

466
00:25:35,226 --> 00:25:38,593
Ninakuomba msamaha kwa kweli.

467
00:25:38,616 --> 00:25:40,683
Samahani, nitaondoka.

468
00:25:40,706 --> 00:25:43,106
Ndio, nimeelewa.

469
00:25:43,129 --> 00:25:44,629
Mchezo wa 12: Hadithi ya Kukatwa Na Mkuu / Kuzungumza Kuhusu Kukatwa Na Mkuu

470
00:25:44,629 --> 00:25:48,596
Leo hii pombe inazidi kuvutia, sivyo?

471
00:25:48,619 --> 00:25:51,638
Kuna jambo lolote limejiri?

472
00:25:51,661 --> 00:25:57,541
Kweli, leo nilikatwa na mkuu wangu kazini.

473
00:25:57,565 --> 00:26:01,531
Eeh, kweli hiyo?

474
00:26:01,554 --> 00:26:04,521
Umeshindwa sana.

475
00:26:04,544 --> 00:26:09,477
Nilikatwa ingawa siyo kosa langu.

476
00:26:09,500 --> 00:26:12,467
Hiyo ni mbaya sana.

477
00:26:12,490 --> 00:26:15,523
Kuna nini kilitokea?

478
00:26:15,546 --> 00:26:22,595
Waliniambia namba katika hati ziko tofauti, lakini mimi sikuzitengeneza.

479
00:26:22,619 --> 00:26:25,266
Hiyo ni mbaya kabisa!

480
00:26:25,290 --> 00:26:28,544
Uliweza kusema kitu?

481
00:26:28,567 --> 00:26:34,034
Mkuu alikuwa na hofu sana, sikueleza chochote.

482
00:26:34,057 --> 00:26:39,623
Hmm, naelewa hisia zako za kusikitika.

483
00:26:39,646 --> 00:26:43,695
Samahani kwa kusema mambo yasiyokuwa mazuri hapa kwenye mkahawa wa pombe.

484
00:26:43,718 --> 00:26:51,966
La hasha! Hii ndiyo sababu ya mikahawa ya pombe, ili kusema mambo yasiyokuwa mazuri.

485
00:26:51,990 --> 00:26:55,390
Nashukuru kwa kunisema hivyo.

486
00:26:55,413 --> 00:26:59,413
Tunyweni sana ili kusahau mambo mabaya!

487
00:26:59,436 --> 00:27:04,330
Ndio, leo nataka kunywa kwa hiari yangu.

488
00:27:04,353 --> 00:27:10,330
Mahusiano kazini ni ngumu sana, sivyo?

489
00:27:10,354 --> 00:27:12,754
Kweli kabisa.

490
00:27:12,777 --> 00:27:15,835
Mimi ninauchoka kuwa na wasiwasi mno.

491
00:27:15,859 --> 00:27:22,625
Mimi pia wiki iliyopita nilikuwa na wasiwasi wa kumfundisha msaidizi wangu.

492
00:27:22,649 --> 00:27:24,905
Eeh, kweli hiyo?

493
00:27:24,928 --> 00:27:27,220
Una wasiwasi gani?

494
00:27:27,244 --> 00:27:32,777
Anafanya kosa hilohilo mara kwa mara ingawa nimemfundisha mara kadhaa.

495
00:27:32,800 --> 00:27:35,457
Hiyo ni ngumu sana.

496
00:27:35,481 --> 00:27:38,374
Kufundisha pia ni kazi ngumu.

497
00:27:38,398 --> 00:27:43,931
Kama unamwambia pole, haifai; ukimwambia kwa ukali, anashuka moyo.

498
00:27:43,954 --> 00:27:48,154
Kila mmoja wetu ana wasiwasi wa kazi.

499
00:27:48,177 --> 00:27:54,196
Hii ndiyo sababu ya kuongea kama sisi, ni dawa bora.

500
00:27:54,219 --> 00:27:55,875
Ni kweli.

501
00:27:55,898 --> 00:27:59,065
Ninaanza kuhisi raha.

502
00:27:59,088 --> 00:28:02,964
Wewe daima hufanya kazi kwa bidii.

503
00:28:02,987 --> 00:28:05,620
Najua.

504
00:28:05,643 --> 00:28:07,377
Asante sana.

505
00:28:07,400 --> 00:28:09,933
Ninahisi kama nitilia machozi.

506
00:28:09,956 --> 00:28:14,974
Acha, piga cheo na kunywa haiboli yako!

507
00:28:14,997 --> 00:28:18,266
Ndio, ninaanza kupata nguvu.

508
00:28:18,289 --> 00:28:20,746
Tunyweni tena!

509
00:28:20,770 --> 00:28:22,807
Nzuri sana.

510
00:28:22,830 --> 00:28:27,275
Tunyweni! Kesho tutafanya bidii tena.

511
00:28:27,298 --> 00:28:28,432
Tunyweni!

512
00:28:28,455 --> 00:28:31,655
Kutoka kesho nitabadili mwelekeo!

513
00:28:31,678 --> 00:28:33,178
Mchezo wa 13: Jinsi ya Kufua Bia / Jinsi ya Kufua Bia Vizuri

514
00:28:33,178 --> 00:28:37,611
Eeh, glasi yako imekwisha.

515
00:28:37,634 --> 00:28:40,434
Oo, kweli.

516
00:28:40,457 --> 00:28:42,955
Sikufahamu.

517
00:28:42,978 --> 00:28:46,469
Nakufua bia ya chupa?

518
00:28:46,493 --> 00:28:48,426
Asante sana.

519
00:28:48,449 --> 00:28:51,886
Asante kwa ukaribu wako.

520
00:28:51,910 --> 00:28:55,357
Aa, karibu, karibu.

521
00:28:55,380 --> 00:28:58,317
Tafadhali shika glasi kwa mikono yako miwili.

522
00:28:58,341 --> 00:29:01,360
Sawa, nitakula/nitakunywa.

523
00:29:01,383 --> 00:29:03,817
To to to...

524
00:29:03,840 --> 00:29:07,293
Uwiano wa povu umefika sawasawa!

525
00:29:07,316 --> 00:29:10,049
Umefanya vizuri sana!

526
00:29:10,072 --> 00:29:13,041
Povu zinaonekana nyororo sana.

527
00:29:13,065 --> 00:29:17,799
Zamani nilikuwa nafanya kazi ya muda mfupi na nilijifunza jinsi ya kumimina.

528
00:29:17,823 --> 00:29:19,589
Nimeelewa.

529
00:29:19,612 --> 00:29:22,346
Hii ni ufundi wa kitaalamu!

530
00:29:22,369 --> 00:29:24,056
Asante sana.

531
00:29:24,079 --> 00:29:28,365
Glasi yako pia imepungua, sivyo?

532
00:29:28,389 --> 00:29:31,227
Aa, kweli ndivyo.

533
00:29:31,250 --> 00:29:34,823
Kwa mara inayofuata tutakunywa nini?

534
00:29:34,846 --> 00:29:38,646
Ningependa kujaribu kunywa sake ya Kijapani.

535
00:29:38,669 --> 00:29:41,269
Nzuri sana!

536
00:29:41,292 --> 00:29:45,177
Ungependa baridi au moto?

537
00:29:45,200 --> 00:29:48,434
Ninapenda ile baridi yenye ladha safi.

538
00:29:48,457 --> 00:29:53,590
Basi, tutaagiza ile pombe ya asili inayopendekezwa na mgahawa huu.

539
00:29:53,613 --> 00:29:55,646
Ninashangaa!

540
00:29:55,669 --> 00:29:59,069
Tutakunywa kwa pamoja kwa kutumia kikombe kidogo.

541
00:29:59,092 --> 00:30:00,930
Nzuri sana.

542
00:30:00,954 --> 00:30:04,687
Mimi pia nitakunywa sake pamoja na wewe.

543
00:30:04,710 --> 00:30:08,244
Nitawaita mhudumu ili tuagize.

544
00:30:08,267 --> 00:30:11,556
Aa, mimi nitawaita.

545
00:30:11,579 --> 00:30:13,594
Samahani!

546
00:30:13,618 --> 00:30:16,418
Una nguvu sana!

547
00:30:16,441 --> 00:30:17,974
Asante sana.

548
00:30:17,997 --> 00:30:22,476
Tafadhali kunywa pombe kwa kasi yako mwenyewe.

549
00:30:22,500 --> 00:30:23,700
Sawa.

550
00:30:23,723 --> 00:30:26,372
Nitajaribu kutokunywa kwa nguvu.

551
00:30:26,396 --> 00:30:29,762
Ni vizuri kunywa maji pamoja na pombe.

552
00:30:29,785 --> 00:30:31,472
Ndiyo.

553
00:30:31,496 --> 00:30:34,229
Tutaagiza maji baridi pia.

554
00:30:34,252 --> 00:30:39,019
Kunywa pombe na maji kwa pamoja hakutakufanya ulevi.

555
00:30:39,042 --> 00:30:41,910
Uangalifu wako ni wa ajabu!

556
00:30:41,934 --> 00:30:44,136
Umefanya vizuri sana.

557
00:30:44,159 --> 00:30:48,559
Tunataka kufurahia kunywa kwa pamoja hadi mwisho.

558
00:30:48,582 --> 00:30:50,052
Sawa.

559
00:30:50,075 --> 00:30:54,146
Tutakwepa pombe tamu polepole.

560
00:30:54,170 --> 00:30:58,103
Basi, tutangojea sake inje.

561
00:30:58,126 --> 00:30:59,626
Sehemu ya 14: Jinsi ya Kutenda Wakati Unapopiga Choo / How to Respond When You Drop Chopsticks

562
00:30:59,626 --> 00:31:05,460
Aa! Nimefanya kosa! Kashan!

563
00:31:05,483 --> 00:31:07,449
Uko salama?

564
00:31:07,472 --> 00:31:10,289
Hujaumia?

565
00:31:10,313 --> 00:31:12,679
Samahani.

566
00:31:12,702 --> 00:31:16,969
Mikono yangu ilisukuma na nikapiga chini vijiti.

567
00:31:16,992 --> 00:31:19,625
Nashukuru kuwa hujaumia.

568
00:31:19,648 --> 00:31:23,892
Samahani kwa kuchafua sakafu.

569
00:31:23,916 --> 00:31:28,149
Aa, usijali, uendelee.

570
00:31:28,172 --> 00:31:31,006
Mimi nitakusanya.

571
00:31:31,030 --> 00:31:36,563
Hapana, mimi nitakusanya, wewe uendelee.

572
00:31:36,586 --> 00:31:38,675
Samahani.

573
00:31:38,698 --> 00:31:41,196
Samahani kwa taabu.

574
00:31:41,220 --> 00:31:45,153
Nitakuletea vijiti vipya.

575
00:31:45,176 --> 00:31:46,870
Asante sana.

576
00:31:46,893 --> 00:31:49,103
Asante sana.

577
00:31:49,127 --> 00:31:54,096
Ungependa vijiti vya kuvunjika au vya plastiki?

578
00:31:54,120 --> 00:31:58,920
Vijiti vya kuvunjika havisukumi na ni vizuri.

579
00:31:58,943 --> 00:32:01,277
Vema, nimekuelewa.

580
00:32:01,301 --> 00:32:04,556
Nitakuletea vijiti vya kuvunjika.

581
00:32:04,579 --> 00:32:08,746
Ninahangaika kama chakula kimechafua nguo zako.

582
00:32:08,769 --> 00:32:12,102
Nguo zako zina uchafu?

583
00:32:12,125 --> 00:32:15,658
Ungependa kutumia kitambaa kitakachoosha?

584
00:32:15,681 --> 00:32:18,615
Nguo zangu ziko salama.

585
00:32:18,638 --> 00:32:21,371
Naomba kitambaa kitakachoosha, tafadhali.

586
00:32:21,394 --> 00:32:23,194
Sawa.

587
00:32:23,217 --> 00:32:27,307
Ndio, nitakuletea kitambaa safi na vijiti mara moja.

588
00:32:27,331 --> 00:32:30,698
Asante kwa kukabiliana na hili upesi.

589
00:32:30,721 --> 00:32:34,054
Umechelewa kidogo.

590
00:32:34,077 --> 00:32:38,124
Haya ni vijiti na kitambaa kitakachoosha.

591
00:32:38,147 --> 00:32:41,186
Asante sana kwa uongozi wako.

592
00:32:41,210 --> 00:32:45,850
Sakafu imetakaswa vizuri, usijali.

593
00:32:45,873 --> 00:32:50,916
Upendo wako umeniacha hisia nzuri.

594
00:32:50,940 --> 00:32:55,906
Samahani kwa kuwashawishi wakati mnalala.

595
00:32:55,929 --> 00:33:01,063
Hapana, mimi ndiye niliyesababisha kwa kuangusha vijiti.

596
00:33:01,086 --> 00:33:05,864
Tafadhali, kula chakula chako kabla hakijapoa.

597
00:33:05,887 --> 00:33:07,499
Sawa.

598
00:33:07,523 --> 00:33:10,956
Ndio, nitakuwa makini sio kuangusha tena.

599
00:33:10,979 --> 00:33:14,412
Endelea na furaha yako polepole.

600
00:33:14,436 --> 00:33:15,936
Asante sana!

601
00:33:15,959 --> 00:33:17,892
Nitakula sasa.

602
00:33:17,915 --> 00:33:20,250
Karibu kula polepole.

603
00:33:20,274 --> 00:33:21,774
Sehemu ya 15: Kukabiliana na Matatizo ya Huduma kwa Wateja

604
00:33:21,774 --> 00:33:25,830
Meneja, naweza kukupata kidogo sasa?

605
00:33:25,853 --> 00:33:27,630
Nini kilichotokea?

606
00:33:27,653 --> 00:33:30,387
Kuna tatizo lolote?

607
00:33:30,410 --> 00:33:36,666
Ndio, mteja kwenye meza ya tatu amevunja glasi.

608
00:33:36,689 --> 00:33:40,907
Hawajiumiza mtu yeyote, sivyo?

609
00:33:40,930 --> 00:33:44,697
Ndio, hakuna mtu aliyeumia.

610
00:33:44,720 --> 00:33:46,886
Hiyo ni nzuri.

611
00:33:46,909 --> 00:33:49,983
Iliyotokeaje hali hiyo?

612
00:33:50,006 --> 00:33:56,140
Glasi iliyojaa mvinyo mwekundu, na imetawanyika sakafuni na kwenye nguo kidogo.

613
00:33:56,163 --> 00:34:00,298
Nguo zimeathiriwa pia, basi.

614
00:34:00,321 --> 00:34:02,593
Hiyo ni mbaya.

615
00:34:02,617 --> 00:34:06,687
Mteja anahisi vibaya sana.

616
00:34:06,710 --> 00:34:11,710
Nituletee vifaa vya kusafisha na kitambaa kitakachoosha mara moja.

617
00:34:11,733 --> 00:34:16,300
Nimeandaa fagio na ufinyanzi wa taka.

618
00:34:16,323 --> 00:34:21,540
Sawa, vipande vya glasi vimeenea, ni hatari.

619
00:34:21,564 --> 00:34:25,164
Mimi nitakusanya vipande kwa fagio.

620
00:34:25,187 --> 00:34:30,154
Nitamwangalia mteja wangu na kuomba msamaha kwa ajili ya nguo zake.

621
00:34:30,177 --> 00:34:34,444
Je, tutalipa gharama za kusafisha nguo?

622
00:34:34,467 --> 00:34:39,151
Tutazingatia hali na kama ni lazima, tutampa kadi yetu ya biashara.

623
00:34:39,174 --> 00:34:40,941
Nimeelewa.

624
00:34:40,964 --> 00:34:43,862
Tutashughulikia kwa utulivu.

625
00:34:43,885 --> 00:34:48,328
Mpeleke mteja mwingine ili wasikanyage vipande vya glasi.

626
00:34:48,352 --> 00:34:53,152
Ndio, nitawaambia wateja wa meza jirani.

627
00:34:53,175 --> 00:34:55,988
Hii ni huduma nzuri.

628
00:34:56,011 --> 00:34:58,302
Tutumike haraka.

629
00:34:58,326 --> 00:35:02,260
Je, tutatoa huduma ya kinywaji kipya?

630
00:35:02,283 --> 00:35:06,090
Tutaweka glasi moja ya mvinyo mwekundu bila malipo.

631
00:35:06,114 --> 00:35:08,388
Vema, nimekuelewa.

632
00:35:08,411 --> 00:35:10,744
Nitaandaa.

633
00:35:10,767 --> 00:35:15,134
Hakuna mtu aliyeumia, lakini tuonyeshe ukweli wetu.

634
00:35:15,157 --> 00:35:19,290
Ndio, naomba, uwepo wako umenisadia sana.

635
00:35:19,313 --> 00:35:23,932
Ni kwa sababu wewe uliniripoti upesi.

636
00:35:23,956 --> 00:35:25,694
Asante sana.

637
00:35:25,717 --> 00:35:28,284
Basi, twende sasa.

638
00:35:28,307 --> 00:35:32,473
Sawa, twende kwenye meza ya tatu.

639
00:35:32,496 --> 00:35:35,173
Angalia chini yako, tafadhali.

640
00:35:35,197 --> 00:35:36,730
Nimeelewa.

641
00:35:36,753 --> 00:35:38,320
Asante.

642
00:35:38,343 --> 00:35:39,843
Mstari wa 16: Maelezo Kabla ya Mapumziko

643
00:35:39,843 --> 00:35:45,939
Muda wa peak umepita, sasa imekuwa kimya.

644
00:35:45,962 --> 00:35:49,296
Saa mbili za ghafla zilikuwa nzito sana!

645
00:35:49,319 --> 00:35:54,588
Sasa nitapumzika kwa dakika arobaini na tano.

646
00:35:54,611 --> 00:35:56,814
Mmeshughulika sana leo.

647
00:35:56,837 --> 00:35:59,371
Pumzika vizuri.

648
00:35:59,394 --> 00:36:04,194
Kabla ya kupumzika, nitafanya maelezo machache ya mabadiliko.

649
00:36:04,217 --> 00:36:05,617
Sawa.

650
00:36:05,640 --> 00:36:07,848
Nitandika kwenye daftari.

651
00:36:07,872 --> 00:36:09,479
Tafadhali.

652
00:36:09,503 --> 00:36:14,669
Kwanza, mteja kwenye meza ya pili anangoja desert.

653
00:36:14,692 --> 00:36:20,492
Ameagiza nini kwa desert? Aisikrimu ya vanilla mbili.

654
00:36:20,516 --> 00:36:22,716
Toa baada ya dakika tano.

655
00:36:22,739 --> 00:36:24,506
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

656
00:36:24,529 --> 00:36:27,529
Baada ya dakika tano, aisikrimu ya vanilla.

657
00:36:27,552 --> 00:36:32,952
Kisha, bili ya meza ya saba ni ya kila mtu pekee.

658
00:36:32,975 --> 00:36:35,608
Hiyo ni hesabu ya kugawana.

659
00:36:35,631 --> 00:36:38,110
Nitahudumia kwenye kaso.

660
00:36:38,133 --> 00:36:42,300
Kuna maelezo kwenye risiti, angalia tafadhali.

661
00:36:42,323 --> 00:36:44,368
Nimeelewa.

662
00:36:44,392 --> 00:36:47,025
Nitahakikisha hakuna makosa.

663
00:36:47,048 --> 00:36:51,181
Muda wa maagizo ya mwisho jikoni ni saa nne na nusu.

664
00:36:51,204 --> 00:36:54,173
Baada ya dakika thelathini.

665
00:36:54,196 --> 00:36:57,455
Je, nitamwambia wateja?

666
00:36:57,478 --> 00:37:02,965
Dakika kumi na tano kabla, mwambie kila meza.

667
00:37:02,989 --> 00:37:06,789
Saa kumi na moja na robo, nitakagua maagizo ya mwisho.

668
00:37:06,812 --> 00:37:08,145
Sawa.

669
00:37:08,168 --> 00:37:10,301
Tafadhali nisaidie.

670
00:37:10,324 --> 00:37:13,821
Je, umejaza vyakula vya kunywa kwenye sakafu?

671
00:37:13,845 --> 00:37:18,578
Nimebadilisha pipa la bia mpya.

672
00:37:18,601 --> 00:37:21,010
Asante, rafiki yangu mwenye uzoefu.

673
00:37:21,034 --> 00:37:22,800
Umefanya kazi vizuri sana!

674
00:37:22,823 --> 00:37:24,390
Asante sana.

675
00:37:24,413 --> 00:37:29,780
Kama kuna tatizo lolote, gonga mlango wa chumba cha mapumziko.

676
00:37:29,803 --> 00:37:31,662
Hakuna matata.

677
00:37:31,685 --> 00:37:34,454
Nitakuwa na uangalifu mkubwa kwa sakafu peke yangu!

678
00:37:34,478 --> 00:37:36,711
Una nguvu sana!

679
00:37:36,734 --> 00:37:39,380
Nitakula chakula cha wafanyakazi.

680
00:37:39,404 --> 00:37:41,970
Leo chakula cha wafanyakazi ni nini?

681
00:37:41,993 --> 00:37:46,193
Ni pilau kubwa maalum kutoka kwa chef!

682
00:37:46,216 --> 00:37:48,829
Waa, nzuri sana!

683
00:37:48,853 --> 00:37:51,228
Endelea na furaha.

684
00:37:51,251 --> 00:37:55,017
Hehe, nitakuweka sehemu yako.

685
00:37:55,040 --> 00:37:58,574
Haray! Kwaheri!

686
00:37:58,597 --> 00:38:00,097
Mstari wa 17: Kula Kupita Kiasi na Lishe Zilizobaki

687
00:38:00,097 --> 00:38:04,330
Eeh, ninaona nimeshiba.

688
00:38:04,353 --> 00:38:08,720
Mimi pia nimeshiba.

689
00:38:08,743 --> 00:38:13,958
Lakini bado kuna chakula mezani.

690
00:38:13,981 --> 00:38:18,548
Tuliamuru sana mwanzoni.

691
00:38:18,572 --> 00:38:22,105
Bado kuna samaki wa kukaanga watatu!

692
00:38:22,128 --> 00:38:26,895
Samaki wa kukaanga hawa ni wakubwa sana.

693
00:38:26,918 --> 00:38:30,884
Je, unaweza kula zaidi?

694
00:38:30,907 --> 00:38:36,197
Ndiyo, mimi pia nina shida sana.

695
00:38:36,221 --> 00:38:38,587
Tafadhali.

696
00:38:38,610 --> 00:38:41,589
Unaweza kula mbili zaidi?

697
00:38:41,613 --> 00:38:48,782
Hmm, inaonekana nzuri sana, lakini je, nitatosha? Kuacha ingekuwa mubaya.

698
00:38:48,805 --> 00:38:53,051
Kweli, kuacha chakula si vizuri.

699
00:38:53,075 --> 00:38:58,694
Wewe ni mwanaume, basi utakuwa na nafasi zaidi tumboni.

700
00:38:58,717 --> 00:39:00,559
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

701
00:39:00,583 --> 00:39:03,762
Nitakula moja kwa bidii.

702
00:39:03,785 --> 00:39:07,857
Usiseme moja tu, kula mbili basi!

703
00:39:07,880 --> 00:39:11,897
Basi, tutaweka limau ili kuwa safi.

704
00:39:11,921 --> 00:39:13,854
Sawa, nzuri.

705
00:39:13,877 --> 00:39:17,337
Limau inafanya iwe rahisi kula.

706
00:39:17,360 --> 00:39:19,219
Nimekula moja.

707
00:39:19,242 --> 00:39:22,132
Ina ladha nzuri na inafutika vizuri.

708
00:39:22,156 --> 00:39:23,650
Incredible!

709
00:39:23,673 --> 00:39:27,307
Basi, nitajaribu kula ile ya mwisho pia.

710
00:39:27,330 --> 00:39:30,977
Eeh, usijitahidi kama huna uwezo.

711
00:39:31,000 --> 00:39:33,833
Sitakuruhusu kujitahidi peke yako.

712
00:39:33,856 --> 00:39:35,990
Nitakula pia.

713
00:39:36,013 --> 00:39:39,246
Hehehe, haunitaki kupigwa, eh?

714
00:39:39,269 --> 00:39:41,343
Nitakula sasa.

715
00:39:41,367 --> 00:39:45,204
Hmm, ni ngumu kidogo lakini ladha ni nzuri.

716
00:39:45,227 --> 00:39:48,560
Mimi pia nimekula moja tena kabisa.

717
00:39:48,583 --> 00:39:51,067
Tumefanya vizuri!

718
00:39:51,090 --> 00:39:53,724
Sahani imesafishwa.

719
00:39:53,748 --> 00:39:56,415
Tumeweza kula vyote!

720
00:39:56,438 --> 00:39:59,004
Nina hisia nzuri ya kufanikiwa.

721
00:39:59,027 --> 00:40:04,227
Mara inayofuata, tuwaze kiasi tunachokila tunapokuwa tunagiza.

722
00:40:04,250 --> 00:40:05,787
Ndiyo.

723
00:40:05,811 --> 00:40:08,984
Kujitwalia sana ni hatari.

724
00:40:09,007 --> 00:40:12,774
Lakini, nimeshinda kula vyote, na hii ni nzuri.

725
00:40:12,797 --> 00:40:17,363
Tumbo langu linaonekana kama linavunja, basi naacha kidogo.

726
00:40:17,386 --> 00:40:18,886
Mstari wa 18: Muda wa Treni ya Mwisho / Kukimbia kwa Treni ya Mwisho

727
00:40:18,886 --> 00:40:21,624
Sasa ni saa ngapi?

728
00:40:21,648 --> 00:40:24,881
Una saa?

729
00:40:24,904 --> 00:40:30,238
Eeh, sasa ni saa tano na robo usiku.

730
00:40:30,261 --> 00:40:34,599
Eeh! Tayari saa hizi?

731
00:40:34,622 --> 00:40:39,640
Kweli, muda unaenda haraka.

732
00:40:39,664 --> 00:40:43,997
Treni yako ya mwisho ni saa ngapi?

733
00:40:44,020 --> 00:40:48,987
Treni yangu ya mwisho ni saa sita kasoro robo usiku.

734
00:40:49,010 --> 00:40:53,693
Treni yangu ya mwisho ni saa tano na nusu usiku!

735
00:40:53,716 --> 00:40:57,089
Kuna dakika kumi na tano tu!

736
00:40:57,112 --> 00:40:59,746
Hiyo ni mbaya sana!

737
00:40:59,769 --> 00:41:02,583
Tutoka mara moja au tutachelewa.

738
00:41:02,606 --> 00:41:06,540
Kwa kufika stesheni, inachukua dakika kumi kwa kutembea.

739
00:41:06,563 --> 00:41:10,940
Kwa kukimbia, tutafika katika dakika tano, lakini ni hatari.

740
00:41:10,963 --> 00:41:15,196
Tutoka sasa mara moja au tutachelewa kabisa.

741
00:41:15,219 --> 00:41:17,839
Haraka tu malipo.

742
00:41:17,862 --> 00:41:20,359
Nitawaita mhudumu.

743
00:41:20,382 --> 00:41:23,751
Sawa, ninaandaa pesa zangu.

744
00:41:23,775 --> 00:41:27,908
Nitakulipa kwa ajili yako, wewe unaweza kwenda mbele.

745
00:41:27,931 --> 00:41:31,774
Eeh, hiyo ni aibu sana!

746
00:41:31,797 --> 00:41:35,174
Tuma pesa kwa LINE baadaye.

747
00:41:35,198 --> 00:41:36,888
Kweli?

748
00:41:36,911 --> 00:41:39,598
Samahani sana.

749
00:41:39,621 --> 00:41:41,221
Umenisaidia sana!

750
00:41:41,244 --> 00:41:44,778
Haraka, chukua koti na begi yako!

751
00:41:44,801 --> 00:41:47,267
Hakuna kitu ulichokisahau, sivyo?

752
00:41:47,290 --> 00:41:49,324
Nimechukua mwavuli pia.

753
00:41:49,347 --> 00:41:53,780
Usirudishe, enda kwa kasi kwenye stesheni.

754
00:41:53,803 --> 00:41:54,936
Ndio!

755
00:41:54,959 --> 00:41:58,736
Leo ulikuwa wa kufurahisha sana.

756
00:41:58,759 --> 00:42:00,537
Asante!

757
00:42:00,561 --> 00:42:03,427
Mimi pia nilifurahi.

758
00:42:03,450 --> 00:42:06,017
Ufike usitume ujumbe.

759
00:42:06,040 --> 00:42:08,286
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

760
00:42:08,309 --> 00:42:11,676
Nitakutumia LINE nikipanda treni salama.

761
00:42:11,699 --> 00:42:14,432
Rudi salama, tafadhali.

762
00:42:14,455 --> 00:42:17,267
Malipo tafadhali!

763
00:42:17,291 --> 00:42:19,691
Sawa, chakula kilikuwa kitamu sana!

764
00:42:19,714 --> 00:42:23,209
Haya! Nitaifanya.

765
00:42:23,232 --> 00:42:25,166
Kimbia!

766
00:42:25,189 --> 00:42:26,649
Ndio!

767
00:42:26,672 --> 00:42:28,808
Lala salama!

768
00:42:28,832 --> 00:42:30,876
Lala salama!

769
00:42:30,899 --> 00:42:32,956
Haraka!

770
00:42:32,979 --> 00:42:36,513
Aa, rudi salama, tafadhali.

771
00:42:36,536 --> 00:42:38,987
Ndio, asante sana!

772
00:42:39,010 --> 00:42:42,983
Eeh, naomba nipate treni.

773
00:42:43,007 --> 00:42:44,507
Sehemu ya 19: Kula Kumalizika, Twende Karaoke

774
00:42:44,507 --> 00:42:47,440
Tumeondoka kwenye mgahawa.

775
00:42:47,463 --> 00:42:50,430
Upepo unaonekana mzuri.

776
00:42:50,453 --> 00:42:52,820
Chakula kilikuwa kitamu, sivyo?

777
00:42:52,843 --> 00:42:56,293
Nimekula sana.

778
00:42:56,316 --> 00:42:59,849
Bado ni saa kumi kamili.

779
00:42:59,872 --> 00:43:02,125
Umefika haraka sana!

780
00:43:02,149 --> 00:43:04,749
Ni kweli.

781
00:43:04,772 --> 00:43:08,138
Baada ya haya tutafanya nini?

782
00:43:08,161 --> 00:43:12,361
Tutakwenda mahali pengine?

783
00:43:12,384 --> 00:43:14,828
Ni mara ya pili.

784
00:43:14,851 --> 00:43:17,651
Karaoke je, unaona nini?

785
00:43:17,674 --> 00:43:19,968
Karaoke.

786
00:43:19,992 --> 00:43:21,926
Nzuri sana.

787
00:43:21,950 --> 00:43:24,517
Ninataka kuimba.

788
00:43:24,540 --> 00:43:29,583
Siku hizi sijaimba, naomba nimbie sana.

789
00:43:29,606 --> 00:43:34,206
Pia ni vizuri kukaa kwa utulivu barani na kuzungumza.

790
00:43:34,229 --> 00:43:38,195
Bar pia ina hali ya kuvutia ya watu wazima.

791
00:43:38,218 --> 00:43:40,852
Leo una hisia gani?

792
00:43:40,875 --> 00:43:45,930
Leo nina nguvu sana, karaoke ni bora.

793
00:43:45,954 --> 00:43:48,003
Imeamuliwa.

794
00:43:48,026 --> 00:43:50,886
Twende karaoke.

795
00:43:50,909 --> 00:43:54,343
Kuna duka la karaoke nzuri karibu.

796
00:43:54,366 --> 00:43:57,499
Duka hilo liko karibu na stesheni?

797
00:43:57,522 --> 00:43:58,655
Sawa.

798
00:43:58,678 --> 00:44:01,950
Liko dakika tatu kwa miguu.

799
00:44:01,974 --> 00:44:04,807
Je, tutachagua huduma ya kunywa bila kikomo?

800
00:44:04,830 --> 00:44:07,397
Bado unataka kunywa?

801
00:44:07,420 --> 00:44:10,296
Chai ya Ulongi pia ni nzuri.

802
00:44:10,320 --> 00:44:13,653
Tuimbe kwa saa moja na kunywe kidogo.

803
00:44:13,676 --> 00:44:15,609
Nakubali.

804
00:44:15,632 --> 00:44:18,684
Tusiendelee sana.

805
00:44:18,708 --> 00:44:22,280
Kesho kuna kazi pia.

806
00:44:22,304 --> 00:44:25,837
Tunapaswa kurudi kabla ya treni ya mwisho.

807
00:44:25,860 --> 00:44:29,227
Utaimba wimbo gani kwanza?

808
00:44:29,250 --> 00:44:33,883
Tutaimba nyimbo maarufu za popu za miaka ya tisini.

809
00:44:33,906 --> 00:44:35,673
Nzuri sana!

810
00:44:35,696 --> 00:44:38,963
Nitaimba pamoja nawe.

811
00:44:38,987 --> 00:44:42,320
Tutaimbe nyimbo za dueti pia?

812
00:44:42,343 --> 00:44:44,010
Inaonekana kuwa fun!

813
00:44:44,033 --> 00:44:46,284
Tujivishe!

814
00:44:46,307 --> 00:44:50,473
Basi, twende dukani kwa karaoke sasa hivi.

815
00:44:50,496 --> 00:44:52,063
Sawa.

816
00:44:52,086 --> 00:44:54,219
Niongoze tafadhali.

817
00:44:54,242 --> 00:44:56,376
Tafadhali njoo hapa.

818
00:44:56,399 --> 00:44:58,332
Nifuate tafadhali.

819
00:44:58,355 --> 00:44:59,855
Mstari wa 20: Misingi ya Malipo / Mambo ya Kujua Kuhusu Malipo kwa Kijapani

820
00:44:59,855 --> 00:45:01,855
Karibu sana.

821
00:45:01,878 --> 00:45:04,170
Ni malipo, ndiyo?

822
00:45:04,193 --> 00:45:05,593
Sawa.

823
00:45:05,616 --> 00:45:08,657
Hii ndiyo bili yako.

824
00:45:08,680 --> 00:45:10,151
Tafadhali.

825
00:45:10,175 --> 00:45:11,869
Asante sana.

826
00:45:11,893 --> 00:45:15,064
Nitakubali bili yako.

827
00:45:15,087 --> 00:45:18,421
Leo, jumla ni pesa ngapi?

828
00:45:18,444 --> 00:45:22,578
Jumla ni elfu nane, mia tano na hamsini shilingi.

829
00:45:22,601 --> 00:45:24,368
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

830
00:45:24,391 --> 00:45:27,724
Je, naweza kutumia kadi ya mkopo?

831
00:45:27,747 --> 00:45:29,314
Sawa.

832
00:45:29,337 --> 00:45:33,024
Kadi za mkopo mbalimbali zinapatikana kwa matumizi.

833
00:45:33,048 --> 00:45:35,427
Nitapenda kutumia kadi ya Visa.

834
00:45:35,451 --> 00:45:38,084
Vema, nimekuelewa.

835
00:45:38,107 --> 00:45:40,840
Nitakubali kadi yako.

836
00:45:40,863 --> 00:45:43,537
Nitapenda kulipa kwa malipo moja tu.

837
00:45:43,560 --> 00:45:45,960
Malipo moja, ndiyo.

838
00:45:45,983 --> 00:45:49,670
Tafadhali weka kadi yako hapa.

839
00:45:49,694 --> 00:45:51,591
Pii...

840
00:45:51,614 --> 00:45:53,548
Je, imemalizika?

841
00:45:53,571 --> 00:45:55,304
Sawa.

842
00:45:55,327 --> 00:45:58,094
Malipo kwa kugusa kimekamilika.

843
00:45:58,117 --> 00:46:02,117
Makaratasi ya siku hizi ni rahisi sana, sivyo?

844
00:46:02,140 --> 00:46:06,173
Ni rahisi kwa sababu unaweza kulipa haraka.

845
00:46:06,196 --> 00:46:10,163
Naomba risiti na cheti cha malipo.

846
00:46:10,186 --> 00:46:11,719
Sawa.

847
00:46:11,742 --> 00:46:15,009
Nitakutoa zote mbili.

848
00:46:15,032 --> 00:46:19,087
Tafadhali andika jina kama 'Mteja' kwenye cheti cha malipo.

849
00:46:19,110 --> 00:46:21,193
Vema, nimekuelewa.

850
00:46:21,217 --> 00:46:24,017
Nitaandika kama 'Mteja'.

851
00:46:24,040 --> 00:46:27,840
Je, tunaweza kulipa kwa sehemu tofauti?

852
00:46:27,863 --> 00:46:29,596
Sawa.

853
00:46:29,619 --> 00:46:32,953
Ndiyo, tunaweza kukubali malipo ya kila mtu pekee.

854
00:46:32,976 --> 00:46:36,746
Mara ijayo nitajaribu kulipa kwa kugawana na marafiki.

855
00:46:36,769 --> 00:46:39,418
Tafadhali usisite kutumia huduma hiyo.

856
00:46:39,442 --> 00:46:42,808
Chakula kilikuwa kitamu sana.

857
00:46:42,831 --> 00:46:45,231
Asante kwa chakula.

858
00:46:45,254 --> 00:46:46,821
Asante sana.

859
00:46:46,844 --> 00:46:49,525
Ninashukuru sana.

860
00:46:49,549 --> 00:46:51,582
Nitakuja tena.

861
00:46:51,605 --> 00:46:56,338
Hii ni risiti yako, cheti cha malipo na kadi yako.

862
00:46:56,361 --> 00:46:57,828
Sawa.

863
00:46:57,851 --> 00:47:00,053
Nimeipokea vizuri.

864
00:47:00,077 --> 00:47:03,277
Asante kwa kututembelea leo.

865
00:47:03,300 --> 00:47:05,598
Karibu tena.

866
00:47:05,622 --> 00:47:07,155
Asante sana.

867
00:47:07,178 --> 00:47:09,453
Kwa heri.